# Implementation Plan - Google Sign-In Integration

Integrate Google Sign-In frontend UI with the existing NestJS backend `/auth/google` endpoint using Google Identity Services (GIS).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Google Client ID**: The backend `.env` already contains `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID="727708804027-nuqmr75gl405o0794q8il97r42scoh3f.apps.googleusercontent.com"`.
> We will configure `NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` in `frontend/.env.local` to match.
